{"4486120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SlidefyingBadaBoom Penguin through a Slipstream: Rise of the Penguins 3", "steam_appid": 4486120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise of the Penguins 3 is a simple linear 3d platformer with a focus on sliding, doing tricks and throwing snowballs to kill enemies. The game is inspired by Ninja Gaiden, bit of Sonic and previous Rise of the Penguins games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also split screen and co op but I wasn't able to test it with anyone else. I tested it with myself to set it up. If people play some feedback on that would be nice but game is primarily single player. I added the split screen / co op just because it seemed like it was worth trying but I prefer playing solo.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486120/extras/4c18bdf6df4ce4dbebc260a6587ac543.poster.avif?t=1784928681\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486120/extras/4c18bdf6df4ce4dbebc260a6587ac543.webm?t=1784928681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486120/extras/4c18bdf6df4ce4dbebc260a6587ac543.mp4?t=1784928681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise of the Penguins 3 is a simple linear 3d platformer with a focus on sliding, doing tricks and throwing snowballs to kill enemies. The game is inspired by Ninja Gaiden, bit of Sonic and previous Rise of the Penguins games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also split screen and co op but I wasn't able to test it with anyone else. I tested it with myself to set it up. If people play some feedback on th